# Use landscape turns the board on its side with the digits beside it, and
# the choice outlives a restart. Every square must stay a finger's width.
wait-for-id game-more
expect Sudoku · Easy 1
tap-id cell-3
tap-id game-more
expect Use landscape
tap-id rotate
wait-idle
expect Sudoku · Easy 1
clean
shot sudoku-landscape
tap-id digit-9
expect 52 left
tap-id game-more
expect Use portrait
clean
shot sudoku-landscape-more
tap-id game-more
restart
wait-for Sudoku · Easy 1
expect 52 left
tap-id game-more
expect Use portrait
tap-id rotate
wait-idle
tap-id game-more
expect Use landscape
tap-id game-more
clean
shot sudoku-portrait-again
